OL,3,GNEWSARoadworks have 'massive impact' on
OL,4,Alocal trade
OL,5,
OL,6,FSmall businesses marooned by year-long
OL,7,Froadworks in Jersey have said they are
OL,8,Fstruggling to survive without financial
OL,9,Fsupport.
OL,11,FThe project to renew 2km (1.2 miles) of
OL,12,Fthe sewer network has closed a major
OL,13,Froad connecting St Helier with northern
OL,14,Fparishes.
OL,16,FTodor Ivanov manages the Union Inn and
OL,17,Fsaid it was only the loyalty of his
OL,18,Fregulars that had kept him afloat.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
